              <li>Hydrotesting and NDT coordination</li>
              <li>Design calculations (B31.4/B31.8)</li>
              <li>Buckling/buoyancy assessments</li>
              <li>Alignment drawings</li>
              <li>Integrity reviews</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Engineering Software:</strong>
