              <li>Ansys (simulation)</li>
              <li>SolidWorks (CAD/CAM/CAE)</li>
              <li>FreeCAD (parametric CAD)</li>
              <li>Mathcad, SMath, Maxima (mathematical calculation)</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Software & Automation:</strong>
            <ul>
              <li>PowerShell & Bash (shell scripting)</li>
              <li>PLC programming</li>
              <li>SBC prototyping</li>
              <li>Software development and reverse engineering</li>
              <li>Frontend and backend development</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Systems & Documentation:</strong>
            <ul>
              <li>Windows/Linux</li>
              <li>Docker (containerization)</li>
              <li>Documentation (LaTeX/Markdown/Typst)</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Safety:</strong>
            <ul>
              <li>H2S & SO2 entry permit (for all sites)</li>
